data: {"id": "e37d138cd90a4ff4-thinking-parallel_evidence-1092", "run_id": "e37d138cd90a4ff4", "node": "parallel_evidence", "node_name": "parallel_evidence", "thinking_type": "ai_message", "tool_name": null, "content": "### 1. 采集到的事实\n\n**Pod 状态与配置验证**\n- **状态**: Pod `aiops-case-04/workload-6584f97c76-7ds5p` 当前持续处于 `Pending` 状态，Container `app` 的 `State` 为 `Waiting`，`Reason` 确认为 **`CreateContainerConfigError`**。\n- **重启计数**: `0`，表明该 Pod 自创建以来（`creationTimestamp`: 2026-09-07T09:32:45Z）未能成功启动过一次容器。\n- **异常原因**: 根据 `kubectl describe` 和 `kubectl get -o yaml` 的 `containerStatuses`，具体的报错原文为：`couldn't find key unavailable-key in Secret aiops-case-04/workload-input`。\n\n**Kubernetes Event 验证**\n- 在过去 3分23秒内（86s前开始，累计12次），`kubel", "status": null, "result_preview": null, "duration_seconds": null, "iteration": 2, "ts_ms": 1788773780554, "lane_stage": "evidence"}

