data: {"id": "e37d138cd90a4ff4-final", "run_id": "e37d138cd90a4ff4", "seq": 1097, "ts_ms": 1788773795583, "status": "success", "answer": "## 📊 异常概览与现象\n\n| 组 | 异常实体 | 异常状态 | 关键错误信息 |\n|---|---|---|---|\n| g1 | `aiops-case-04/workload-6584f97c76-7ds5p` | CreateContainerConfigError | Pod aiops-case-04/workload-6584f97c76-7ds5p 持续处于 Pending 状态，Container `app` 处于 Waiting 状态，错误原因 `CreateContainerConfigError`。 |\n\n---\n\n## 🕵️ 证据内容 · g1\n\n| # | 类型 | 来源 | 真实原始结果 | 诊断作用 |\n|---|---|---|---|---|\n| 1 | K8s State | fact-1aa91238fb57 | 容器 `app` 处于 `CreateContainerConfigError` 状态 | 确认容器启动因配置问题被拦截的事实 |\n| 2 | K8s Event | fact-6747a75e8209 | Warning Failed: `couldn't find key unavailable-key in Secret aiops-case-04/workload-input` (86s 内出现 12 次) | 明确指认导致配置加载失败的缺失键名与目标 Secret |\n| 3 | K8s State | fact-75eec022f4c4 | 容器等待原因为 `couldn't find key unavailable-key in Secret aiops-case-04/workload-input` | 辅助确认 Kubernetes 内部对配置缺失的判定 |\n| 4 | Metric | fact-1fcce268208d | `kube_pod_container_status_waiting_reason{reason=\"CreateContainerConfigError\", container=\"app\"}` = 1 | 外部监控确认异常状态已持续且未被其他原因替代 |\n\nKubernetes 事件与容器状态共同锁定了配置加载失败的根本原因，Metric 数据证实了该异常状态在观测窗口内持续存在，无其他竞争因素。\n\n## 🎯 根因分析 · g1\n\n### 因果链\n```text\nSecret `aiops-case-04/workload-input` 中不存在键 `unavailable-key` → 容器启动时挂载/注入配置失败 → kubelet 抛出 CreateContainerConfigError 拦截容器创建 → Pod 持续处于 Pending 状态且 `app` 容器处于 Waiting 状态\n```\n\n### 根因结论\n已确认的根因为：Secret 资源 `aiops-case-04/workload-input` 中缺失了应用容器 `app` 启动所依赖的键 `unavailable-key`（证据：[#2](#证据内容--g1) 事件日志与 [#1](#证据内容--g1) 状态）。这一配置错误直接导致 kubelet 无法完成容器环境初始化，从而引发当前的 `CreateContainerConfigError` 故障现象。\n\n---\n\n## 📊 性能统计\n\n```text\n├─ 总耗时: 1.0m\n├─ 问题定位: 19.0s\n├─ 并发证据采集: 35.1s\n│  └─ g1 aiops-case-04/workload-6584f97c76-7ds5p: 35.1s (Evidence 27.6s, RCA 7.4s)\n└─ 汇总总结: 7.4s\n```\n\n📋 Runbook 参考\n\n- **g1 aiops-case-04/workload-6584f97c76-7ds5p**: pod-config-error\n", "answer_source": "workflow", "elapsed_seconds": 61.629, "metrics": {"run_id": "e37d138cd90a4ff4", "mttr": {"value": "1.0m", "seconds": 61.637293100357056, "pass": true, "threshold": "< 10.0m"}, "evidence_completeness": {"value": "0%", "collected": 0, "planned": 0, "pass": false, "threshold": "> 90%"}, "root_cause_confidence": {"value": "48%", "pass": false, "threshold": ">= 80%"}, "runbook_coverage": {"matched": true, "runbook_id": "pod-config-error", "pass": true, "score": 1.0, "breakdown": [{"description": "Runbook 引用", "weight": 0.5, "score": 1.0, "weighted_score": 0.5}, {"description": "核心 Runbook 识别", "weight": 0.3, "score": 1.0, "weighted_score": 0.3}, {"description": "Runbook 结论关联", "weight": 0.2, "score": 1.0, "weighted_score": 0.2}]}, "confidence_breakdown": [{"name": "evidence_strength", "weight": 0.35, "score": 0.0, "weighted_score": 0.0, "description": "加权证据完整率", "detail": "加权完整率 0%"}, {"name": "causal_chain", "weight": 0.2, "score": 1.0, "weighted_score": 0.2, "description": "因果链完整性", "detail": "完整因果链"}, {"name": "tool_coverage", "weight": 0.1, "score": 0.3, "weighted_score": 0.03, "description": "关键探针覆盖率", "detail": "工具成功率 30%"}, {"name": "runbook_match", "weight": 0.15, "score": 1.0, "weighted_score": 0.15, "description": "Runbook 匹配质量", "detail": "核心: pod-config-error"}, {"name": "llm_self_score", "weight": 0.2, "score": 0.5, "weighted_score": 0.1, "description": "LLM 自评分数", "detail": "来源: layer_confidence, 分数: 50%"}], "confidence_penalties": [], "evidence_breakdown": {"total": 0, "breakdown": {}}, "performance": {"total_duration_ms": 61637.293100357056, "llm_calls": 10, "llm_duration_ms": 58337.509870529175, "tool_calls": 9, "executed_tool_calls": 9, "deduplicated_tool_calls": 0, "successful_tool_calls": 9, "failed_tool_calls": 0, "tool_duration_ms": 8067.154407501221, "tool_wall_duration_ms": 2960.3896141052246}, "nodes": {"layer": {"name": "问题定位", "duration_ms": 19038.958072662354, "success": true}, "parallel_evidence": {"name": "并发证据采集", "duration_ms": 35121.49953842163, "success": true}, "evidence": {"name": "evidence", "duration_ms": 0.0, "success": true}, "rca": {"name": "rca", "duration_ms": 0.0, "success": true}, "conclusion": {"name": "汇总总结", "duration_ms": 7447.277784347534, "success": true}}, "success": true, "errors": []}}

